      "changes": [
        "Same registered attempt controls all nested metadata, archive URL and body requests. Typed stop forbids later transport/publication admission.",
        "Policy-aware clients drop before ordinary synchronous Runtime teardown on the actual registered native worker, then stage admission is checked again. No detached runtime destruction or bounded teardown claim."
      ]
