      ],
      "classification": "intentional_native_observed_body_and_cancellation_contract",
      "changes": [
        "One absolute 30s budget spans each send and complete body; stage control checked before/after every await.",
        "Response owner drops the response on early return; Content-Length rejects early and cumulative observed chunks are checked before append.",
        "Metadata 1 MiB, archive 64 MiB, retained error diagnostic 8 KiB; diagnostic URL 1 KiB. Limits are compatibility policy, not all-memory/wire caps.",
        "Successful metadata retains response headers and bounded owned bytes, reconstructing local HttpResponse for unchanged charset/BOM/replacement decoder; no new request/client, archives remain raw.",
        "Existing request routing, route pool, policy wrapper, headers/proxy/DNS behavior remains delegated to current helpers."
      ]
    },
