      "classification": "existing_policy_regressions_and_new_real_http_fixtures",
      "changes": [
        "Two prior route/policy assertions run typed helpers inside registered native probes, preserving assertions.",
        "Eight new test functions with eleven fixture cases cover blocked headers/body, content-length and observed overflow, exact cap, diagnostic prefix, one absolute deadline, typed pipeline stop and charset/BOM compatibility.",
